The '''Wobani system''' was a [[star system]]<ref name="Battlefront" /> located in the [[Bryx sector]] of [[the galaxy]]'s [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]<ref name="RO World Locations" /> that contained the [[planet]] [[Wobani]].<ref name="Battlefront" />

